1
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 2=

2
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,120
Help me.

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:11,920
Please help me.

4
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,080
You...

5
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,920
Your Spirit Core hasn't been unlocked?

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,960
I feel so hot...

7
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,480
I'm burning up...

8
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,240
Help me...

9
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,440
(Her Spirit Core isn't even unlocked.)

10
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,560
(Why would she risk her life
to save me?)

11
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,080
Your Highness.

12
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,920
Xia Honglian did this.

13
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,040
She drugged her with Spring Dream.

14
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,600
Should I

15
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,280
find her a virgin?

16
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:57,920
No need.

17
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,320
She saved me first.

18
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:00,400
I

19
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,520
won't let her lose her virtue
because of Xia Honglian.

20
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,200
But, Your Highness,

21
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:06,000
she has to sleep with a man
to neutralize the drug.

22
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,480
There is another way.

23
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,520
Activate her Spirit Core.

24
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:12,480
Your Highness,

25
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:13,600
you're still recovering

26
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,560
from your injuries.

27
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,920
Besides, unlocking her Spirit Core
could damage your cultivation.

28
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,360
She isn't worth the risk.

29
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,080
I've made my decision.

30
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:21,320
Go.

31
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,240
Wait outside.

32
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,040
Yes.

33
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,320
(Such a powerful seal.)

34
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,160
(Is this the Huangyan Secret Art?)

35
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,160
This is...

36
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:26,040
the Reversion Flower.

37
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,880
(Where's the model I told you
to get for your brother?)

38
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,640
(You can't do anything right.)

39
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,840
(I've been working all day.)

40
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,440
(I deserve some ice cream, right?)

41
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:09,440
Ice cream.

42
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:11,680
A model.

43
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:13,840
What are those?

44
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,120
Her clothes look strange too.

45
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,960
They aren't Huangyan clothes.

46
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,440
Your Highness.

47
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:24,880
Are you all right?

48
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:27,400
It worked.

49
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,560
Send men to Huangyan Kingdom.

50
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,400
Check if anything unusual
has happened lately.

51
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,600
Find out if

52
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,640
any female spies arrived recently.

53
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:37,920
You mean...

54
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:41,600
This woman

55
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,520
must have ties to Huangyan.

56
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:44,600
Yes.

57
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,760
When did I get back?

58
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,720
Jin Yunlie brought you back last night.

59
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,040
Why are you here?

60
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,040
Wait.

61
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,400
Jin Yunlie?

62
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,440
Didn't Xia Honglian say

63
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,760
the only cure for Spring Dream was...

64
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:09,160
Then...

65
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,200
Did he and I...

66
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,880
(We didn't... did we?)

67
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,720
He activated your Spirit Core.

68
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,000
He used Spiritual Power

69
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,320
to force the drug from your body.

70
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,400
You mean

71
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,320
my Spirit Core is activated now?

72
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,480
That's right.

73
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:23,400
So train hard,

74
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:25,640
win the Huyun Martial Trial,

75
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,640
then find a way to get the Xuanji Jade.

76
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:28,520
Wait.

77
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,760
My Spirit Core was just activated,

78
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,040
and you want me to win?

79
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,400
Isn't that asking too much?

80
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,840
Not at all.

81
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,200
Your Spirit Core is powerful.

82
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,200
You must take first place.

83
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,080
Come on.

84
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,280
My Spirit Core may be powerful,

85
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,720
but I know nothing about cultivation.

86
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,320
That's why you need a teacher.

87
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,760
Jin Yunlie is the perfect choice.

88
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,040
(Oh, no.)

89
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:56,640
Um...

90
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:57,960
Can...

91
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:59,520
Can I refuse?

92
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,280
No.

93
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:16,200
I never had a choice in the real world.

94
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:19,000
Now it's the same in the Xuanji Realm.

95
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:19,760
Well...

96
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,200
No time to worry about that.

97
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,400
Time to pull myself together

98
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,480
and get back to work.

99
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,720
(Yellow Dragon,
Prophet of the Xuanji Realm)

100
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,400
The wheels of fate are already turning.

101
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,520
In the end,

102
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,520
you must make them fall in love.

103
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,400
It is her destiny.

104
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:39,720
As for me,

105
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,840
while you used the Wheel of Divination,

106
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,240
I stole nine lifetimes at her side.

107
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,240
That's enough for me.

108
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:49,440
Despite all Shenlyu's schemes,

109
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,160
we

110
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,080
still have a slim chance of survival.

111
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,280
So what if you kill me?

112
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,960
If Heaven and Earth show no mercy,

113
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,480
someone will rewrite the rules.

114
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,400
(Shenlyu, Creator of the Xuanji Realm)

115
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,200
Then one day,

116
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,840
you appeared with a prophecy

117
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,440
and told me there was still hope
for the Xuanji Realm.

118
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,120
Yes.

119
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,280
She is our last hope
of turning the tide.

120
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,280
Our combined cultivation

121
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,800
can only trigger ten reincarnations.

122
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:39,760
Yet

123
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,840
we've already failed nine times.

124
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,240
This is our final chance.

125
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,280
Shisi.

126
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,280
I'm worried...

127
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,080
Don't worry,

128
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,400
I know this better than anyone.

129
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,200
Only after Xi Yuan has suffered

130
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,360
and loved

131
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,400
can she be reborn through pain.

132
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,280
That's the only way

133
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,880
our plan can truly begin.

134
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,520
(Xuanji Realm)

135
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,720
(Xuanji Realm, 200 years ago)

136
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:07,080
(Shenlyu held absolute power.)

137
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,680
(He was cold and ruthless,)

138
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:11,280
(and controlled every deity.)

139
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,760
(Love between deities)

140
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,440
(was strictly forbidden.)

141
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,520
(Xuanji Realm: Phoenix Deity)
(Despite that,)

142
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:20,120
(Phoenix and White Tiger fell in love.)

143
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,320
(Their love was genuine.)

144
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,800
(Shenlyu was furious,)

145
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,840
(but dared not act rashly.)

146
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:29,720
(Phoenix possessed the Power of Hope,)

147
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,960
(the only force that could
overthrow his rule.)

148
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,600
Huyun Deity.

149
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,320
Deities cannot fall in love.

150
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,560
It violates the divine law.

151
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,080
You are the Deity of Justice,

152
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,960
(Xuanji Realm: Huyun Deity)
yet you knowingly broke the law

153
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,960
by falling in love with Phoenix.

154
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,640
As punishment,

155
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:50,040
I shall rip out your love soul
and erase your memories.

156
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:52,840
No!

157
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:06,960
Go.

158
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,480
In the name of love,

159
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,840
strip her of the Heart of Hope

160
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:12,480
and kill her.

161
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:15,200
I will not fail you, Lord Shenlyu.

162
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,280
Well?

163
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:29,680
Did Shenlyu approve of our relationship?

164
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,880
Lord Shenlyu is very understanding.

165
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,440
Of course he approved.

166
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,720
Really?

167
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,200
That's wonderful.

168
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,200
Yes.

169
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,160
Except...

170
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,240
you must die.

171
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,760
Why?

172
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,800
(I saved Phoenix)

173
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,280
(and sent her to your world.)

174
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,280
(One year here is ten years
in the Xuanji Realm.)

175
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,920
(Once you come of age,)

176
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,680
(you can return and overthrow Shenlyu.)

177
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:33,520
Your Highness.

178
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,840
Our spy in Huangyan reports

179
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:35,520
that years ago,

180
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,600
a princess was born with white flames.

181
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:38,920
A secret art was used on her,

182
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:39,760
and she was secretly executed.

183
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,520
She must be Xi Yuan.

184
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,200
The princess who was secretly executed?

185
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,400
I don't think

186
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,600
her arrival in Huyun

187
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,760
was a coincidence.

188
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,560
Huangyan may have sent her

189
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:50,000
to steal Huyun's secrets

190
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,360
and take them back.

191
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,160
Keep investigating.

192
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:53,720
Yes.

193
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:54,920
Also, Your Highness,

194
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,520
the Military Affairs Office

195
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,560
recently intercepted

196
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:59,520
a secret letter between
the Xia family and Longyuan.

197
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,520
(With Demon Lord's blood, the Xia family
can win the Crown Princess title.)

198
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:06,120
(With Longyuan's aid, we shall
soon dominate Huyun.)

199
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:09,160
The Xia family obtained
Demon Lord's blood from Longyuan.

200
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,560
They plan to rig the martial trial.

201
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:13,680
When did Longyuan

202
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,240
start colluding with the Demon Lord

203
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,120
and obtain his blood?

204
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,760
Our spy in Longyuan reports

205
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,440
that Longyuan Deity

206
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,760
recently died.

207
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:24,320
Longyuan's ruler may
have pledged loyalty to the Demon Lord.

208
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,520
Longyuan has turned to evil.

209
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,120
They must have allied
with the Xia family

210
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,080
to obtain Xuanji Jade.

211
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,400
The Xia family is too powerful now.

212
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:36,840
We can only bring them down

213
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,880
by exposing their crimes at court.

214
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,840
When is the martial trial?

215
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:41,880
Your Highness,

216
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,040
Chancellor Xia just met His Majesty.

217
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,920
His Majesty then scheduled the trial
for three days from now.

218
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,440
Three days?

219
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,840
Xia Ling must be

220
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,160
in a hurry

221
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,120
to make his daughter

222
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,760
Crown Princess.

223
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,040
Kui Mulang.

224
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,360
Among the tribute maidens,

225
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,560
is there anyone we can use?

226
00:10:59,280 --> 00:10:59,800
Your Highness,

227
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,640
the Xia family has probably
pulled strings already.

228
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,000
Besides,

229
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,280
Demon Lord's blood has made
Xia Honglian much stronger.

230
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,480
Even our shadow guards

231
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,520
may not be her match.

232
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:09,480
Wait.

233
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,440
I can help you.

234
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,640
Why are you here?

235
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:16,280
I'm here to be your disciple.

236
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,400
If you'll train me,

237
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,600
I'll fight for you.

238
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,720
Why are you so eager

239
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:22,560
about the trial

240
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,760
when you'll be facing Xia Honglian?

241
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:25,560
Haven't you suffered

242
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,400
enough already?

243
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:27,680
Your Highness,

244
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,760
I think

245
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,880
Miss Xi Yuan

246
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,680
is hopelessly in love with you

247
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,120
and wants to be Crown Princess.

248
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,720
That's why she volunteered.

249
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:35,680
Yes, exactly.

250
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,640
I want to be Crown Princess.

251
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:38,920
Like they say,

252
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,880
if you don't want to be Crown Princess,

253
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:41,880
you're no tribute maiden at all.

254
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,800
Do you truly want to help me?

255
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,680
Let's call it

256
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,920
helping each other out.

257
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,040
You want to

258
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,800
get evidence against Xia Honglian.

259
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:50,560
I want

260
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:51,640
to be the Crown Princess.

261
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:52,800
Besides,

262
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,040
my Spirit Core was just activated,

263
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,480
so I have incredible Spiritual Power.

264
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:56,680
Your Highness,

265
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:58,280
you won't regret investing in me.

266
00:11:58,640 --> 00:11:59,640
What makes you so sure

267
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:01,160
your Spiritual Power is that strong?

268
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,920
I'm a sure bet.

269
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,000
Becoming my disciple

270
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,440
won't be that easy.

271
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:13,400
Starting tomorrow,

272
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,640
you'll be my personal maid.

273
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:17,400
First,

274
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,080
I'll assess your cultivation potential.

275
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:23,440
Yes.

276
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:25,840
Your Highness,

277
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,160
didn't you suspect
she was a Huangyan spy?

278
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:28,840
Why

279
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,640
are you keeping her so close?

280
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,000
Keeping her close

281
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,560
makes it easier

282
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:35,200
to watch her every move.

283
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,880
Your Highness.

284
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,440
Please have some tea.

285
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,160
Your Highness,

286
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,760
how's the pressure?

287
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:57,360
(No one is this attentive)

288
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:58,920
(without wanting something.)

289
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:00,280
Your Highness,

290
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,120
so, how's my potential looking?

291
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,000
When do we start training?

292
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,440
Report!

293
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:06,760
Your Highness,

294
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,400
urgent military news.

295
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:17,520
Huangyan and Huyun have
long been enemies.

296
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,600
I am

297
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,280
the Crown Prince of Huyun Kingdom.

298
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,480
I must set an example.

299
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:22,680
Send out my orders.

300
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,400
Tomorrow,

301
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:24,880
we attack Huangyan,

302
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,960
and capture its royal family alive.

303
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,000
Yes.

304
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,360
What do you think?

305
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:33,800
Well...

306
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,080
You're absolutely right, Your Highness.

307
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:40,240
I'll always support you, Your Highness.

308
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,760
(She doesn't look like a spy.)

309
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,520
(More like a lovestruck fool.)

310
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:46,800
Enough.

311
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,480
That's all for today.

312
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:49,080
Leave.

313
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,000
What?

314
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,040
Leave.

315
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,840
(Why is he so hard to please?)

316
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,040
Jin Yunlie.

317
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:05,680
You think the formation
left by Huyun Deity

318
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:07,640
can trap me?

319
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,360
If no deity could trap you,

320
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:13,640
why did you wait

321
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,960
until Longyuan Deity died

322
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,280
to collude with Longyuan?

323
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:20,280
(Demon Lord of the Xuanji Realm)

324
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:23,120
So what if you absorb my Demonic Energy?

325
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:25,760
As long as evil remains
in people's hearts,

326
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:29,440
one day I will return
to the mortal world.

327
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:43,280
(For now,)

328
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:45,360
(I can only seal the Demon Lord)

329
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,680
(in a temporary slumber.)

330
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,280
(I must use this time)

331
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:51,240
(to put an end
to the Xia family's plot.)

332
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:00,520
Your Highness.

333
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,200
Just as you predicted,

334
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,560
the carrier pigeon bearing our order
to attack Huangyan

335
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,200
was secretly intercepted
by Miss Xi Yuan.

336
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:08,960
She must be

337
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,640
secretly copying the message now.

338
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,040
As expected.

339
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:14,640
She's finally shown her true colors.

340
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:23,880
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

341
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:30,680
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

342
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:37,480
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

343
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:44,280
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
